---
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About"
  description="Sinan Can Demir — CS student at UT Dallas, open source developer, interested in software engineering and security."
>
  <article class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-16">
    <header class="mb-12">
      <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-50 mb-4">About me</h1>
    </header>

    <div class="prose dark:prose-invert prose-zinc max-w-none prose-a:text-indigo-600 dark:prose-a:text-indigo-400">
      <p>
        Hi, I'm <strong>Sinan Can Demir</strong> — a computer science student at the University of Texas at Dallas.
        I build open source software and write about the things I learn along the way: software engineering,
        security, data systems, and personal growth.
      </p>

      <p>
        I'm drawn to systems that are honest about their tradeoffs. Most of my work lives on
        <a href="https://github.com/sinan-can-demir" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub</a>.
      </p>

      <h2>What I work with</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Backend: Python, FastAPI, PostgreSQL</li>
        <li>Data: dbt, DuckDB, Apache Kafka, Streamlit</li>
        <li>ML: Prophet, scikit-learn</li>
        <li>Infrastructure: Docker, GitHub Actions</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Get in touch</h2>
      <p>
        Email me at <a href="mailto:fanflowphoto@gmail.com">fanflowphoto@gmail.com</a> or find me on
        <a href="https://github.com/sinan-can-demir" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
